{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"\\\"I Love You\\\" and Auto Memoir Dolls\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hodgins retrieves Violet from the hospital, as Major Gilbert asked him to look out for her. After they meet Gilbert's relatives, he offers her a job.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e9182bfcfe47.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「愛してる」と自動手記人形\"},{\"title\":\"Not Coming Back\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Violet tries to adjust to her new job: she needs to learn typing, and her coworkers question whether she has the right demeanor for letter writing.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e918871eb4d4.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「戻って来ない」\"},{\"title\":\"May You Be an Exemplary Auto Memoir Doll\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Violet enrolls in a Doll training course. Her classmate Luculia befriends her, though she has her own problems with her war veteran brother.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e9188bacc037.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「あなたが, 良き自動手記人形になりますように」\"},{\"title\":\"Don`t Be a Tool, Become Someone That Matches with Their Name\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2018-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Iris goes to her home village on an assignment, Violet accompanies her. Iris's birthday party sparks a disagreement with her family.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e9188fd94591.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「君は道具ではなく, その名が似合う人になるんだ」\"},{\"title\":\"You Write Letters That Bring People Together?\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2018-02-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Princess Charlotte is to have a public correspondence with her betrothed, and Violet is entrusted with writing the letters on her highness’s behalf.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e91897796702.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「人を結ぶ手紙を書くのか?」\"},{\"title\":\"Under Some Starry Sky\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2018-02-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Violet travels to the country of Astrea to work with transcribers copying damaged manuscripts. Her partner Leon has a past not unlike hers.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e9189b8cb334.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「どこかの星空の下で」\"},{\"title\":\"\\\" \\\"\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2018-02-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A playwright with writer's block and a tragic past summons Violet to the country of Genetrix to help him finish a script. They both learn about grief.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e9189f087014.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「 」\"},{\"title\":\"Episode 8\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Violet learns that Major Gilbert is listed as missing in action, but his family members think he is dead. Unable to cope, she remembers the war.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e918a1895241.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Violet Evergarden\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Heartbroken, Violet withdraws from her job and questions whether she even has the right to be an Auto Memory Doll. Then, she receives a letter.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e918a5bd98d2.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン」\"},{\"title\":\"A Loved One Will Always Watch Over You\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Violet travels to a countryside mansion to write letters for a war widow, but her young daughter Ann resents her presence.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e918a9478936.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「愛する人は ずっと見守っている」\"},{\"title\":\"I Don`t Want Anybody Else to Die\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Against Hodgins' wishes, Violet takes a job from a soldier at a military base in Ctrigall, a former enemy nation now engulfed in civil war.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e918ad1c4040.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"「もう, 誰も死なせたくない」\"},{\"title\":\"Episode 12\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2018-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Major's older brother is ordered to defend the signing ceremony from former Gardarik forces opposed to peace.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e918b06a420e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"The Auto Memory Doll and \\\"I Love You\\\"\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The signing ceremony concludes, officially bringing an end to the war. While writing letters for an air show, Violet composes a letter to the Major.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/330139/episodes/5e918b4371d20.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"自動手記人形と「愛してる」\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}